  partName: Gasket (5)
  description: The Gasket (5) is a thin, flat seal positioned at the bottom-center-front
    of the engine, responsible for preventing fluid leaks and maintaining the engine's
    internal pressure. Composed of Frame material, this gasket provides a reliable
    barrier against leaks, ensuring the engine operates efficiently and effectively.
    Notably, its thin design allows for a precise fit, minimizing the risk of leaks
    and maximizing engine performance.
